    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- Ki +2 and ATK & DEF 200%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- All allies' ATK & DEF 30%{passiveImg:up_g}, plus an additional Ki +2 and\nATK & DEF 20%{passiveImg:up_g} for characters who also belong to the\n\"Planet Namek Saga\" Category\n- Ki +2 and ATK & DEF 40%{passiveImg:up_g} for the character and allies whose\nnames include \"Goku\" (Captain Ginyu, Jr., etc. excluded)\n*When attacking*\n- ATK & DEF 200%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Chance of evading enemy's attack & damage reduction rate 20%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*For 1 turn from the character's entry turn*\n- Chance of evading enemy's attack 20%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*As the 2nd or 3rd attacker in a turn*\n- ATK & DEF 200%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- High chance of evading enemy's attack\n*After performing 2 attacks in battle*\n- {passiveImg:once}Interrupts the attacked enemy\n*After performing 3 attacks in battle*\n- {passiveImg:once}Interrupts the attacked enemy\n*After performing 4 attacks in battle*\n- {passiveImg:once}Interrupts the attacked enemy",
